---
/**
 * The free entry conversation.
 *
 * One path, no alternatives, no upsell in the margin. The page's whole job is
 * to remove the reason a person talks themselves out of getting in touch:
 * the belief that they need a finished brief first.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { writeDirectHref, contactEmail } from '../data/navigation';

const bring = [
  'an unfinished idea',
  'several possible directions',
  'something you want to build',
  'something you want to understand',
  'something already good that could become more',
  'a business that has lost its original thread',
  'a situation where another perspective would be useful',
];

const outcomes = [
  ['A useful question', 'the one worth answering before anything else is decided.'],
  ['A direction', 'which of the possible routes actually deserves attention.'],
  ['A product match', 'which Meish product fits, if one does.'],
  ['A first test', 'the smallest thing that would tell you something real.'],
  ['A small preview', 'a fragment of the work itself, made during the call.'],
  ['A clear no', 'a decision not to proceed. This is a good outcome too.'],
];
---

<Base
  title="20-minute Meish Fit Check — €0"
  description="A short conversation to see whether there is a useful next step together. You do not need a finished brief. Free, 20 minutes, English or Finnish."
>
  <section class="head">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="head__eyebrow">€0 · 20 minutes · English or Finnish</p>
      <h1>20-minute Meish Fit Check</h1>
      <p class="head__lead">
        A short conversation to see whether there is a useful next step together.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="bring-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="bring-title">You do not need a finished brief.</h2>
      <p class="band__intro">You can come with:</p>
      <ul class="bring">
        {bring.map((b) => <li>{b}</li>)}
      </ul>
      <p class="band__intro">
        If you can describe the situation out loud, that is enough to start. Working it out is
        part of the twenty minutes, not a prerequisite for booking them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--soft" aria-labelledby="happens-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="happens-title">What happens in the twenty minutes</h2>
      <ol class="happens">
        <li>
          <span class="happens__no" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <p>You describe the situation. However roughly it comes out.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="happens__no" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <p>We ask what we would need to see to understand it properly.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="happens__no" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <p>We say what we notice, including when what we notice is “nothing yet”.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="happens__no" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
          <p>We agree what the next step is, or agree that there isn’t one.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band" aria-labelledby="leave-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="leave-title">What you leave with</h2>
      <dl class="outcomes">
        {
          outcomes.map(([what, detail]) => (
            <div class="outcomes__row">
              <dt>{what}</dt>
              <dd>{detail}</dd>
            </div>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
      <p class="band__intro">
        There is no proposal waiting at the end and nothing to decline. If Meish is not the right
        thing for your situation, saying so is the useful answer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--ink on-dark" aria-labelledby="book-title">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="book-title">Book it</h2>
      <p class="band__intro">
        Write one or two sentences about the situation. You will get a reply with a couple of
        times to choose from.
      </p>
      <p class="band__action">
        <a class="button button--primary" href={writeDirectHref}>Write to Meish</a>
      </p>
      <p class="band__small">
        Or email <a href={writeDirectHref}>{contactEmail}</a> directly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .head {
    padding-block: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.5rem) clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
    background: var(--color-ivory);
  }
  .head__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }
  .head h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 400;
    max-width: 18ch;
  }
  .head__lead {
    margin: 1.15rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    max-width: 44ch;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  .band {
    padding-block: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
  }
  .band--soft {
    background: var(--color-cream);
  }
  .band--ink {
    background: var(--meish-navy);
    color: var(--meish-ivory);
  }
  .band--ink :global(h2) {
    color: var(--meish-ivory);
  }
  .band h2 {
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .band__intro {
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.64;
    max-width: 52ch;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  .band--ink .band__intro {
    color: rgba(244, 239, 232, 0.86);
  }
  .band__action {
    margin: 1.75rem 0 0;
    max-width: none;
  }
  .band__small {
    margin: 1.1rem 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: rgba(244, 239, 232, 0.7);
  }

  .bring {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 1.35rem 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-navy);
  }
  .bring li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.35rem;
  }
  .bring li::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0.72em;
    width: 0.6rem;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-line-strong);
  }

  .happens {
    list-style: none;
    margin: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem) 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    max-width: 44rem;
  }
  .happens li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0 1rem;
    padding-block: 1.05rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .happens li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .happens__no {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    padding-top: 0.25em;
  }
  .happens p {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .outcomes {
    margin: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.25rem) 0 0;
  }
  .outcomes__row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 13rem) minmax(0, 34rem);
    gap: 0.3rem 2.5rem;
    padding-block: 1rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .outcomes__row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-line);
  }
  .outcomes dt {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .outcomes dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }

  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .outcomes__row {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 0.3rem;
      padding-block: 1.1rem;
    }
  }
</style>
